### 1. Créer une partie
POST http://localhost:8000/api/matches
X-API-Key: mon-secret-local
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. Kills — remplace TON-MATCH-ID par l'UUID reçu au-dessus
POST http://localhost:8000/api/matches/TON-MATCH-ID/kills
X-API-Key: mon-secret-local
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"killer_roblox_id": 111, "victim_roblox_id": 222, "weapon": "sword"},
  {"killer_roblox_id": 222, "victim_roblox_id": 111, "weapon": "gun"},
  {"killer_roblox_id": 111, "victim_roblox_id": 333, "weapon": "sword"}
]

### 3. Terminer la partie
POST http://localhost:8000/api/matches/TON-MATCH-ID/end
X-API-Key: mon-secret-local
Content-Type: application/json

{"winning_team": "red", "duration_seconds": 300}

### 4. Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:8000/api/leaderboard

### 5. Stats joueur
GET http://localhost:8000/api/players/111/stats

### 6. Test sécurité — doit faire 401
POST http://localhost:8000/api/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{}